  "description": "Modern C++20 high-performance mathematical function expression parser, numerical calculus & FFT engine, standard bidirectional LaTeXLive converter & vector rendering module, and raster visualization library. Features zero-heap VM execution, implicit equation contour extraction (LHS = RHS), parametric curves, 2D scalar fields, Win32 double-buffered HWND rendering, syntax highlighting & autocomplete editor, portable GMP/mini-gmp multi-precision evaluation, and extensible pipeline hooks.",
  "id": "Formulaic",
