  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0: Major feature release: Interactive 3D surface preview (Sombrero/sinc wave, Painter's depth sorting, dual-sided diffuse lighting, Viridis colormap shading, mouse drag rotation and wheel zoom), standard LaTeXLive bidirectional converter (to_latex and to_script), vector LaTeX visual math rendering module with dynamic DelimitedBox scaling and high-resolution PNG export, multi-precision GMP/mini-gmp arithmetic integration, asymptotic pole elimination, and real-time interactive LaTeXLive HUD in test_editor_window.",
